    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kslz364",
      "content": "• Regional disparities."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "New Industrial Policy was announced on July 24, 1991, marking the formal start of LPG reforms.",
        "Dr. Manmohan Singh was the Finance Minister who presented the historic 1991 Budget.",
        "Rupee devaluation was carried out in two steps in July 1991 to restore BoP stability.",
        "Reforms coincided with the start of the 8th Five-Year Plan (1992–1997)."
